One-Liners for Instant Troubleshooting

lsof -i :443     # What’s using this port  
du -sh * | sort -hr  # Disk usage ranked  
journalctl -xe    # System logs for error events  
netstat -tulpn    # All open ports  
strace -p <pid>    # Trace what a process is doing

Bonus:
history | grep ssh — Never underestimate audit trails
